{"term":{"label":"親","occurrences":17,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i","title":"離婁上","description":"孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"事","id":"事"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"受","id":"受"},{"form":"命","id":"命"},{"form":"失","id":"失"},{"form":"實","id":"實"},{"form":"師","id":"師"},{"form":"弗","id":"弗"},{"form":"悅","id":"悅"},{"form":"本","id":"本"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"舜","id":"舜"},{"form":"親","id":"親"},{"form":"身","id":"身"},{"form":"道","id":"道"},{"form":"養","id":"養"}],"edges":[{"weight":3.253277251585533,"source":"養","target":"聞"},{"weight":0.25131442828090617,"source":"人","target":"親"},{"weight":0.5877866649021191,"source":"人","target":"師"},{"weight":1.2383742310432684,"source":"悅","target":"事"},{"weight":2.1138429683971682,"source":"悅","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.18283583988412,"source":"悅","target":"親"},{"weight":0.5877866649021191,"source":"悅","target":"道"},{"weight":3.0301337002713233,"source":"命","target":"受"},{"weight":2.624668592163159,"source":"命","target":"師"},{"weight":1.2809338454620642,"source":"舜","target":"道"},{"weight":1.9315214116032138,"source":"舜","target":"事"},{"weight":1.08422355121601,"source":"舜","target":"親"},{"weight":1.9315214116032138,"source":"本","target":"身"},{"weight":1.2383742310432684,"source":"本","target":"事"},{"weight":1.08422355121601,"source":"本","target":"親"},{"weight":1.9315214116032138,"source":"失","target":"事"},{"weight":2.336986519711378,"source":"失","target":"聞"},{"weight":1.7773707317759555,"source":"失","target":"親"},{"weight":1.9315214116032138,"source":"失","target":"身"},{"weight":1.2383742310432684,"source":"事","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.2881963555419462,"source":"事","target":"親"},{"weight":1.461517782357478,"source":"事","target":"聞"},{"weight":1.0560526742493137,"source":"事